-- Affine channel kinds under the post-migration architecture.
--
-- The wrappers (**! / **?) are real constructors whose inner must be a
-- session-kind (1S) protocol. The wrapper itself has kind 1C (linear
-- channel). Each line below asserts that the wrapper-over-session is
-- well-kinded at kind 1C.
--
-- Drive with: AffineKindingValidSpec (errorsAreFailures).

case **!(!Int; Close) : 1C

case **!(!Char; Skip; Close) : 1C

case **!(!Int; !Char; Close) : 1C

case **!(Skip; !Int; Close) : 1C

case **?(?Int; Wait) : 1C

case **?(?Char; Skip; Wait) : 1C

case **?(?Int; ?Char; Wait) : 1C

case **?(Skip; ?Int; Wait) : 1C
